sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant K as Kestrel
    participant M as Middleware Pipeline
    participant R as Routing
    participant A as Action Endpoint
    participant S as Service Layer
    C->>K: HTTP request
    K->>M: HttpContext
    M->>R: authenticated, correlated, logged
    R->>A: route values and model binding
    A->>S: command or query
    S-->>A: result
    A-->>M: IActionResult or IResult
    M-->>K: response headers and body
    K-->>C: HTTP response
